{"words": [{"text": "يَوْمَ", "translation": "(On the) Day"}, {"text": "تَبْيَضُّ", "translation": "would become white"}, {"text": "وُجُوهٌۭ", "translation": "(some) faces"}, {"text": "وَتَسْوَدُّ", "translation": "and would become black"}, {"text": "وُجُوهٌۭ ۚ", "translation": "(some) faces"}, {"text": "فَأَمَّا", "translation": "As for"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those whose"}, {"text": "ٱسْوَدَّتْ", "translation": "turn black"}, {"text": "وُجُوهُهُمْ", "translation": "[their] faces "}, {"text": "أَكَفَرْتُم", "translation": "Did you disbelieve"}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "إِيمَـٰنِكُمْ", "translation": "your belief"}, {"text": "فَذُوقُوا۟", "translation": "Then taste"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابَ", "translation": "the punishment"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "for what"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "you used to"}, {"text": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translation": "disbelieve"}], "sahih": "On the Day [some] faces will turn white and [some] faces will turn black. As for those whose faces turn black, [to them it will be said], \"Did you disbelieve [i.e., reject faith] after your belief? Then taste the punishment for what you used to reject.\""}